          "hypothesis_as_declared_by_model": "Replacing separately allocated vector<bool> rows with one row-padded uint64_t bitmap will preserve the packed O(N²)-bit representation while reducing allocation fragmentation and making blocked-cell storage contiguous. This isolates a data-layout locality change while retaining the existing DP traversal.",
          "transformations_as_declared_by_model": {
